  "status": "Delivered Pause/Settings cleanup preview; source, desktop renderer, APK checks and Drive metadata readback passed. Physical Android acceptance remains open.",
  "changes": [
    "Pause and Settings remove decorative flavour text and use clearer headings and spacing. The layouts keep functional controls and confirmations readable.",
    "Pause now fades its sharp menu over softened, darkened frozen gameplay. Resume fades the menu first, then removes the blur before gameplay clocks advance. Reduced Motion uses the settled presentation immediately.",
    "The warm studio spotlight, grounded heartbeat stamp and quiet hum are included in this preview for the first time. Saved Sound and Reduced Motion preferences, background handling and restored-run startup are retained.",
    "The source includes public-build capability safeguards, while this debug preview retains Developer settings, Infinite money and local commerce testing. No real ad or purchase provider is connected.",
    "All ten gameplay JSON files and all three gameplay fingerprints remain byte-identical to v0.7.4. Prices, peg strength tiers, authored maps and gameplay rules are unchanged."
  ],
